        rdfs:comment                   "Two pieces of a ribbon sewed together, white ribbed silk ground, edges cut in irregular scallops and finished with very narrow gold galloon with looped edges, irregularly scalloped edges follow the outlines of the central fat silver serpentine, over serpentine repeat fo floral spray alternately running left and right, part of spray brocaded with silver, part brocaded with gold, part stamped, and part painted with green."@en ;
